The Rust server, protocol transport, Codex adapter, application shell, and Android
host application are new implementations. HAPI's TypeScript Hub is not required.
Reference checkouts are excluded from generated release artifacts.
See scripts/fetch-hapi.sh to reproduce the upstream checkout.

